# Copy to .env and fill in.

# OpenAI API key (https://platform.openai.com/api-keys). Required.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Key for the /analytics dashboard. If empty, analytics only opens from this machine.
ADMIN_KEY=

PORT=3000

# Analytics storage. Required on Vercel (its file system is temporary).
# Connecting Upstash Redis from the Vercel Marketplace sets these for you
# (as KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN, which also work).
# Leave blank locally to log to data/*.jsonl instead.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

Model settings (defaults shown). Any Responses API model with web search works,
e.g. gpt-5.4, gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-terra.
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4
OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT=medium   # none | minimal | low | medium | high | xhigh
CLASSIFIER_MODEL=gpt-5.4-mini

Prices in USD for the dashboard's cost estimate (blank = estimate hidden).
Copy them from your model's pricing page.
PRICE_INPUT_PER_M=
PRICE_CACHED_INPUT_PER_M=
PRICE_OUTPUT_PER_M=
PRICE_PER_1K_SEARCHES=

Contact details the AI and the site point visitors to
CONTACT_EMAIL=lagos@gostudyin.com
CONTACT_PHONE=+234 810 912 4550

Questions allowed per visitor IP per 10 minutes
RATE_LIMIT_PER_10_MIN=12

Time zone for analytics days and hours
ANALYTICS_TZ=Africa/Lagos

Set when running behind a reverse proxy/load balancer (e.g. 1) so visitor IPs are correct
TRUST_PROXY=
